1
00:00:01,730 --> 00:00:06,800
They were almost at the track field for practice when someone's loud comment caught their attention.

2
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:09,820
But practice is going to be brutal.

3
00:00:10,410 --> 00:00:12,960
Can't wait to see these humans totally wipe out.

4
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:14,650
Weaklings that they are.

5
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:20,040
Violet's head whipped around to face the jerk who'd just spoken.

6
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:27,120
Even without Alice, her walking encyclopedia, she could tell from his words that he was a werewolf.

7
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:31,120
Only those arrogant werewolves got a kick out of human suffering.

8
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:39,440
Maybe she was prejudiced, because the violets still couldn't wrap her head around humans and werewolves peacefully coexisting at school.

9
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:41,760
It was a ticking time bomb.

10
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:47,460
The werewolf must have felt her glare because he turned, his eyes locking with hers.

11
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:49,940
He looked momentarily surprised.

12
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:53,280
Then his eyes narrowed and he growled.

13
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:56,000
What are you staring at, Prey?

14
00:00:57,340 --> 00:00:58,420
Violet raised an eyebrow.

15
00:00:59,160 --> 00:01:01,280
Oh, so that's how he wanted to play it?

16
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:08,120
Unfortunately for him, she had a smart mouth that usually got her into trouble, not out of it.

17
00:01:08,880 --> 00:01:11,460
She licked her lips, ready for a coming showdown.

18
00:01:12,260 --> 00:01:14,100
Alice seemed to sense her intentions.

19
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:19,840
Her eyes widened, and she shook her head, silently warning her to back off.

20
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:21,300
Too late.

21
00:01:21,300 --> 00:01:24,300
Oh, I'm sorry."

22
00:01:24,300 --> 00:01:25,300
Violet shot back.

23
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:28,620
Are you, like, dying for my attention, dog?

24
00:01:29,060 --> 00:01:31,460
And there it was.

25
00:01:32,150 --> 00:01:33,120
Alice gasped.

26
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:35,610
Pretty much everyone nearby did, too.

27
00:01:36,940 --> 00:01:38,040
Oh, no, she didn't.

28
00:01:38,720 --> 00:01:39,560
But Violet did.

29
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:44,400
Everyone with an earshot froze like Violet had just committed a major crime.

30
00:01:45,320 --> 00:01:46,840
Seconds later, whispers started.

31
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:53,860
and Violet caught snippets like, she's so dead and Grant's gonna rip her apart.

32
00:01:55,370 --> 00:01:58,700
Despite the ominous whispers, Violet felt strangely confident.

33
00:01:59,540 --> 00:02:01,120
She refused to back down from bullies.

34
00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:02,890
Well, kind of.

35
00:02:04,130 --> 00:02:04,420
What?

36
00:02:04,950 --> 00:02:05,900
Did you just call me?

37
00:02:06,820 --> 00:02:13,700
The werewolf grant growled, his nostrils flaring as his wolf started to emerge, triggered by her words.

38
00:02:14,670 --> 00:02:16,960
You mean the same way you called me prey?

39
00:02:17,700 --> 00:02:19,600
Or can't you take a joke, dog?

40
00:02:20,480 --> 00:02:21,440
She sassed back.

41
00:02:21,450 --> 00:02:21,650
back.

42
00:02:22,100 --> 00:02:22,740
Violet!

43
00:02:23,780 --> 00:02:26,660
Alice cried, desperately trying to pull her away.

44
00:02:27,220 --> 00:02:28,660
But Violet wouldn't budge.

45
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:33,100
She was bigger than Alice, and the smaller girl couldn't move her an itch.

46
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:38,020
Violet saw the moment Grant's eyes flashed amber, his wolf taking over.

47
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:44,740
While she might be impulsive and hot -headed, Violet wasn't completely stupid.

48
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:51,400
She started mentally calculating how many steps it would take to reach the exit where help would surely come.

49
00:02:52,180 --> 00:02:53,380
She was positive it would.

50
00:02:54,500 --> 00:02:56,660
I'll teach you a lesson today.

51
00:02:57,690 --> 00:03:01,580
Grant growled, a mix of man and wolf, as he lunged toward her.

52
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:07,420
Violet braced herself to run when, suddenly, someone stepped in.

53
00:03:07,860 --> 00:03:13,140
A strong hand grabbed Grant's arm and, in front of everyone's shocked eyes, polled.

54
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:18,800
The sound was sickening, a wet, cracking noise of shattering bones filled the hall.

55
00:03:19,660 --> 00:03:20,320
Oh god!

56
00:03:21,330 --> 00:03:24,290
Someone gasped behind her, followed by the sound of vomiting.

57
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:28,880
Thankfully, it wasn't Alice, or she would have been splattered.

58
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:34,580
Violet froze, eyes wide with shock as Asher nightshade took over.

59
00:03:35,380 --> 00:03:38,390
He wasn't some fairytale prince swooping in to save the day.

60
00:03:39,220 --> 00:03:45,440
No knight in shining armor here, just a dark knight, rescuing her with an aura of pure menace.

61
00:03:46,980 --> 00:03:48,160
Hello, Grant.

62
00:03:48,950 --> 00:03:55,560
Asher drawed, his voice dripping with possessiveness as he crushed the werewolf's arm like a plastic toy.

63
00:03:56,380 --> 00:04:00,140
Did I just hear you call my violet your prey?

64
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:07,760
Hasn't anyone told you that I, and only I, hunt her alone?

65
00:04:09,140 --> 00:04:14,900
Normally Violet would have rolled her eyes at his words and argued, but she was too horrified to speak.

66
00:04:15,670 --> 00:04:19,860
She could only stand there, dumbfounded by Asher's brutal display of dominance.

67
00:04:19,860 --> 00:04:24,230
I'm s -s -s -sorry, Elva."

68
00:04:24,340 --> 00:04:25,580
Grant moaned.

69
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:28,760
His earlier bravado replaced by desperate pleas.

70
00:04:29,900 --> 00:04:31,440
Asher remained unmoved.

71
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:32,460
Really?

72
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:33,620
Are you?

73
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:37,680
His voice was ice -cold as he twisted the arm further.

74
00:04:38,740 --> 00:04:39,880
Heck, I am!

75
00:04:40,330 --> 00:04:42,400
I seriously am, dad!

76
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:47,560
Grant cried out like a child as Asher applied even more pressure.

77
00:04:48,620 --> 00:04:54,300
Noddy, Grant, now, what do you do when you're sorry?"

78
00:04:54,300 --> 00:04:56,600
Asher teased, glancing at Violet.

79
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:59,700
Grant followed his gaze and seemed to get the message.

80
00:05:00,500 --> 00:05:03,960
He instantly bowed his head, stiffly and stammered.

81
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:06,820
I'm so sorry, Miss Violet.

82
00:05:08,080 --> 00:05:11,380
What are you sorry for, dog?"

83
00:05:11,380 --> 00:05:14,620
Asher taunted, chuckling like he was enjoying the whole thing.

84
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:15,940
That psycho.

85
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:20,000
For trying to hurt you, it will never happen again.

86
00:05:21,180 --> 00:05:26,780
Grant apologized, his tone sincere now, realizing Asher wasn't in the mood for games.

87
00:05:28,090 --> 00:05:29,280
There you go.

88
00:05:30,500 --> 00:05:35,380
Asher finally let go, and Grant gasped like a drowning man surfacing for air.

89
00:05:36,370 --> 00:05:43,100
The move had looked simple, but Asher had not only broken bones, but also dislocated Grant's shoulder.

90
00:05:44,020 --> 00:05:45,240
It had been pure hell.

91
00:05:46,570 --> 00:05:48,180
Now, move along, doggie.

92
00:05:48,900 --> 00:05:51,900
Go find the school nurse and have her deal with that nasty injury.

93
00:05:53,100 --> 00:05:58,060
Asher dismissed him with a wave, and Grant shuffled away, head hung low.

94
00:05:59,080 --> 00:06:00,700
The crowd partying to let him leave.

95
00:06:01,760 --> 00:06:04,860
With Grant gone, Asher turned his attention to Violet.

96
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:07,980
The look on his face told her he intended to.

97
00:06:08,610 --> 00:06:11,780
Well, she wasn't sure, but it wasn't good.

98
00:06:12,990 --> 00:06:13,520
Oh no.

99
00:06:15,340 --> 00:06:22,820
Standing up to Grant hadn't scared her, but the dark, unsettling smile on Asher's face Scent shivers down her spine.

100
00:06:23,770 --> 00:06:25,260
Nope, not doing this.

101
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:33,640
Violet spun around to run, but Asher moved just as fast, grabbing her around the waist as if he'd predicted her move.

102
00:06:34,690 --> 00:06:36,060
Put me down, you jerk!

103
00:06:37,590 --> 00:06:41,400
She yelled, struggling as he effortlessly tossed her over his shoulder.

104
00:06:41,400 --> 00:06:44,040
her weight seemed like nothing to him.

105
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:50,920
That is how you thank your savior, my violet.

106
00:06:51,970 --> 00:06:56,720
He laughed, continuing to walk, unfazed by her punches to his back.

107
00:06:57,980 --> 00:07:03,460
When his teasing became too overwhelming, he swatted her butt and Violet instantly froze.

108
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:07,480
This has to be a nightmare, she thought.

